phrase: multiply range items by {factor} at most {max_val}
test: list=2,4,6,8 factor=2 max_val=10
expect: => i=4 r=0.0 ok=true s="range scaled at most: 10" errors=0 n=4 res=[4,8,10,10] cache=0 hits=0
