phrase: replace alternate sample condition every other using {fill_val}
test: list=10,20,30,40,50 fill_val=0
expect: => i=2 r=0.0 ok=true s="filled alternate observations: 2" errors=0 n=5 res=[10,0,30,0,50] cache=0 hits=0
