phrase: group function times into bucket size {bucket}
phrase: cluster error function times using {bucket}
test: list=12,18,25,42 bucket=10
expect: => i=4 r=0.0 ok=true s="grouped function times bucketed 4" errors=0 n=4 res=[10,10,20,40] cache=0 hits=0
